WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.000
From the biggest stadiums To the coziest holes in the wall From house parties to porch hangs to pride celebrations From your favorite fuss shop to your local Indian spot From noodle bars to sports bars to salsa bars There's a Molson with your name on it Canadian ultra XL
从最大的体育场到最温馨的街角小店，从家庭派对到门廊聚会再到骄傲游行，从你最爱的精品店到当地的印度餐馆，从面馆到运动酒吧再到萨尔萨舞吧，总有一款莫尔森啤酒为你而生，加拿大超大号。

2
00:00:25.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Molson Everyone in Must be legal drinking age Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents if you feel at any time you need support Please contact your local crisis center for suggested phone numbers for confidential support Please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website The names of several individuals in this episode have been changed Superbike motorsports in Chesney, South Carolina wasn't just the motorcycle dealership
莫尔森，人人皆可享用，必须达到法定饮酒年龄。我们的剧集涉及严重且往往令人痛苦的事件，如果您在任何时候感到需要支持，请联系当地的危机中心获取保密支持的电话号码。请查看您应用内或我们网站上本集的节目说明。本集中几位当事人的姓名已作更改。南卡罗来纳州切斯尼的超级摩托车运动中心不仅仅是一家摩托车经销商。

3
00:01:13.000 --> 00:02:04.000
For bike enthusiasts in the small town and its surrounding area The store was a place to hang out with like-minded people and even make friends 30-year-old Scott Ponder who owned the store worked there with his best friend Brian Lucas who was 29 The dynamic between the pair had added to the friendly atmosphere There were a number of regular customers who dropped by whenever they had spare time That was exactly what Noel Lee was doing on the afternoon of Thursday, November 6th, 2003 Noel had met Scott and Brian through the store and grew to consider them two of his closest friends The trio were all planning to go to a motocross race the following night and Noel wanted to stop by the store to collect the tickets
对于这个小镇及其周边地区的摩托车爱好者来说，这家店是一个与志同道合的人聚会甚至结交朋友的地方。30岁的店主斯科特·庞德与他29岁的挚友布莱恩·卢卡斯一起在那里工作。两人之间的互动增添了友好的氛围。有许多常客只要有空就会顺道过来。这正是诺埃尔·李在2003年11月6日星期四下午所做的事情。诺埃尔通过这家店认识了斯科特和布莱恩，并逐渐将他们视为自己最亲密的朋友。三人原计划第二天晚上去看一场摩托车越野赛，诺埃尔想顺道去店里取票。

4
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:49.000
He called the shop first at around 2 30 p.m. To check if this suited Scott's mother 52-year-old Beverly Guy answered the phone She helped out at the dealership with bookkeeping and other administrative tasks Beverly said it would be fine for Noel to drop in At around 3 p.m. Noel pulled his BMW into the store's parking lot Set back from a stretch of a two-lane highway called Paris Bridge Road Superbike motorsports was one of the only retail spaces in the vicinity It boarded a cattle field and was surrounded by rolling hills and mostly residential buildings
他先是在下午2点30分左右给店里打了电话，确认这个时间是否方便斯科特的母亲。52岁的贝弗利·盖伊接了电话，她在店里帮忙处理簿记和其他行政事务。贝弗利说诺埃尔随时可以过来。下午3点左右，诺埃尔把他的宝马车开进了店里的停车场。超级摩托车运动中心坐落在一段名为巴黎桥路的双车道公路旁，是附近仅有的几家零售店之一。它紧邻一片牛场，周围环绕着起伏的丘陵和大部分住宅建筑。

5
00:02:49.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Noel parked in one of the five car spaces directly in front of the shop He immediately noticed something strange in the doorway of the dealership Sprawled across the ground in a manner that propped the glass door open was a person It was the store manager Brian Lucas Noel Lee got out of his car Assuming Brian was playing some kind of prank Noel moved towards the storefront when he abruptly stopped in his tracks Partially hidden beneath the bonnet of the car. He'd parked next to was the body of Scott Ponder a Pool of blood had formed around him
诺埃尔把车停在店门前五个停车位中的一个。他立刻注意到店门口有些异样。一个人横卧在地上，挡住了玻璃门，使其处于开启状态。那是店经理布莱恩·卢卡斯。诺埃尔·李下了车。他以为布莱恩在搞什么恶作剧，便朝店门口走去，却突然停下了脚步。在他旁边停放的汽车引擎盖下，部分遮挡着斯科特·庞德的尸体，他周围形成了一滩血迹。

6
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Closer up Noel could see there was blood around Brian as well The glass from the door held open by his body had been shattered Realizing the severity of the situation Noel raced past Brian's body and into the store He headed to the sales counter and used the dealership's phone to call 911 Then he saw something else A third body was sprawled on the floor just outside the showroom in the middle of the dealership It was Scott's mother Beverly Guy When Noel got through to a 911 operator he cried out
走近一看，诺埃尔发现布莱恩周围也有血迹。被他身体挡住的玻璃门上的玻璃已经破碎。意识到情况的严重性，诺埃尔冲过布莱恩的尸体进入店内。他径直走向销售柜台，用店里的电话拨打了911。然后他看到了另一幕。在店中间的展厅外，地板上横卧着第三具尸体。那是斯科特的母亲贝弗利·盖伊。当诺埃尔接通911接线员时，他大喊道：

7
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:27.000
Apparently everyone's been shot up here Everybody's laying down in a pool of blood. His mum has been shot the mechanics been shot Although Noel had only seen three bodies he believed that there would be a fourth somewhere as well Chris Sherbert the dealership's 26 year old mechanic was always working at this time Of day often in the garage area Explaining this to the operator Noel was told not to go looking for Chris Instead he should leave the store for his own safety and wait outside for the first responders to arrive Noel did as he was told exiting the dealership and walking across the road where he sat down in some grass
“这里好像所有人都被枪杀了，每个人都躺在血泊中。他妈妈被枪杀了，技工也被枪杀了。”虽然诺埃尔只看到了三具尸体，但他认为第四个人也应该在某处。26岁的店里技工克里斯·谢伯特通常在这个时间工作，经常在车库区域。诺埃尔向接线员解释了这一点，但被告知不要去寻找克里斯。相反，为了自身安全，他应该离开商店，在外面等待急救人员到达。诺埃尔照做了，他走出商店，穿过马路，坐在草地上。

8
00:05:27.000 --> 00:06:10.000
Police descended on Superbike Motorsports and secured the building Scott Ponder, Brian Lucas and Beverly Guy were all deceased As Noel Lee had predicted the dealership's mechanic Chris Sherbert was also at the shop He was found slumped over a black Suzuki motorcycle in the dealership's garage He was dead too All four victims had been shot multiple times with a 9mm pistol Including at least once in the chest and once in the forehead The headshots implied that the killings had been a deliberate execution rather than a random mass shooting
警察赶到超级摩托车运动中心并封锁了建筑物。斯科特·庞德、布莱恩·卢卡斯和贝弗利·盖伊均已死亡。正如诺埃尔·李所预料的那样，店里的技工克里斯·谢伯特也在店里。他被发现倒在车库里的一辆黑色铃木摩托车上。他也死了。所有四名受害者都被9毫米手枪多次射击，包括至少一次胸部和一次前额。头部中弹意味着这是一场蓄意的处决，而非随机的大规模枪击。

9
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:51.000
The perpetrator had missed very few of their shots even though some of their victims had been moving targets 18 shell casings were recovered from the scene They were dusted for prints but yielded none Nor were there any unidentified hand or fingerprints elsewhere in the store Investigators also had no luck sourcing foreign DNA The only clue they came across was a bill of sale for a black Suzuki Motorcycle It appeared as though Scott Ponder had been in the process of writing the bill when the shootings began
凶手几乎没有射偏，尽管一些受害者当时正在移动。现场回收了18枚弹壳。警方对弹壳进行了指纹提取，但一无所获。店里其他地方也没有发现任何无法识别的手印或指纹。调查人员在获取外来DNA方面也没有进展。他们发现的唯一线索是一张黑色铃木摩托车的销售单。看起来斯科特·庞德在枪击开始时正在填写这张单据。

10
00:06:51.000 --> 00:07:31.000
It didn't include a buyer's name or any other identifying information such as a credit card number The bill was for the same black Suzuki that mechanic Chris Sherbert had been working on He had been prepping it for his new owner When he was shot and killed To police it seemed likely that the buyer of the black Suzuki and the shooter were one and the same Based on the locations of the body they put together a theory of how the slayings had likely unfolded The shooter had left the store after arranging to buy the bike Then they had sneaked into the garage via a car and went to the police
单据上没有买家的姓名或其他任何身份信息，如信用卡号。这张单据是为技工克里斯·谢伯特正在处理的那辆黑色铃木摩托车开具的。他当时正在为新车主做准备，结果被枪杀。对警方来说，黑色铃木的买家和凶手很可能是同一个人。根据尸体的位置，他们推断出了杀戮可能发生的过程。凶手在安排购买摩托车后离开了商店。然后他们通过汽车潜入车库，并前往警察局。

11
00:07:31.000 --> 00:08:25.000
After arranging to buy the bike then they had sneaked into the garage via a rear door They shot Chris Sherbert from behind while he was preparing the motorcycle for delivery Next the gunman headed through the showroom encountering Beverly Guy and killing her Scott Ponder and Brian Lucas had heard the gunshots and were fleeing the scene as the shooter pursued them Brian was gunned down in the store's doorway Scott had made it a little further outside to the parking lot After incapacitating all four victims the shooter had methodically walked to each one and fired a final shot into their foreheads Investigators shut down Paris Bridge Road for three days as they processed the crime scene
在安排购买摩托车后，他们通过后门潜入车库。他们在克里斯·谢伯特准备交付摩托车时从背后射杀了他。接着，枪手穿过展厅，遇到了贝弗利·盖伊并杀害了她。斯科特·庞德和布莱恩·卢卡斯听到了枪声，在枪手追赶时试图逃离现场。布莱恩在店门口被枪杀。斯科特则跑得稍远一点，到了停车场。在制服所有四名受害者后，枪手有条不紊地走到每个人身边，向他们的前额补了最后一枪。调查人员封锁了巴黎桥路三天，以处理犯罪现场。

12
00:08:25.000 --> 00:09:23.000
The attack was thought to have taken place at around 2 45 p.m Superbike motorsports customer Noel Lee had called the store at around 2 30 p.m and spoken to Beverly Guy She'd just dropped by to run some errands after taking her mother to a chemotherapy appointment Beverly was planning to deposit some earnings at the bank but told Noel to drop in as Scott and Brian would both be there By the time Noel arrived 30 minutes later, they were all dead Although many vehicles drove by the store throughout the day, there weren't that many customers around in the middle of a weekday afternoon Consequently investigators didn't have many eyewitness accounts to go on A couple who were known to deal drugs had been seen near the store near the time of the shooting
袭击被认为发生在下午2点45分左右。超级摩托车运动中心的顾客诺埃尔·李在下午2点30分左右给店里打了电话，并与贝弗利·盖伊交谈过。她当时刚送完母亲去化疗，顺道过来办些杂事。贝弗利计划去银行存钱，但告诉诺埃尔可以过来，因为斯科特和布莱恩都会在店里。当诺埃尔30分钟后到达时，他们都已经死了。虽然全天有很多车辆经过商店，但在工作日的下午，店里并没有多少顾客。因此，调查人员没有多少目击者证词可供参考。一对以贩毒闻名的夫妇在枪击发生时曾出现在店附近。

13
00:09:23.000 --> 00:10:17.000
The woman had appeared upset and was heading away from superbike motorsports as her male partner chased after her Officers managed to track the couple down but cleared them of any involvement in the crime Several vehicles were also spotted in the area One was Rad and an early 90s model, perhaps a Honda Civic or Chevy Cavalier Another was a dark blue late model Chevrolet pickup truck with chrome exhaust and bed rails And the third was a smaller sportier pale blue pickup truck Officers asked for anyone with information about these vehicles to come forward Very quickly the murders at the superbike motorsports were being compared to another attack that had taken place five months earlier
那名女子看起来很不安，正从超级摩托车运动中心离开，她的男性同伴在后面追赶她。警官们设法找到了这对夫妇，但排除了他们与犯罪的任何关联。该地区还发现了多辆车辆。一辆是红色的，90年代初的车型，可能是本田思域或雪佛兰卡瓦利。另一辆是深蓝色、较新款的雪佛兰皮卡，带有镀铬排气管和车斗栏。第三辆是一辆较小的、更具运动感的浅蓝色皮卡。警官们呼吁任何有这些车辆信息的人站出来。很快，超级摩托车运动中心的谋杀案就被拿来与五个月前发生的另一起袭击案进行比较。

14
00:10:17.000 --> 00:11:14.000
31 miles southwest of Chesney in the town of Greer, there had been a robbery at Blue Ridge Savings Bank on May 16 A bank teller and two customers had been shot and killed execution style in a back room Just like the superbike shootings, the bank attack had taken place in the middle of the day with no witnesses around It didn't appear to be random And similar to the location of superbike motorsports, the Blue Ridge Savings Bank was near a highway in a relatively isolated area A red car was seen driving to the bank at 1 24 p.m. Six minutes before the shooting and a red car was spotted near superbike motorsports as well As of November 2003, the perpetrator of the bank shootings hadn't been caught or identified
在切斯尼西南31英里的格里尔镇，5月16日发生了一起蓝岭储蓄银行抢劫案。一名银行出纳员和两名顾客在后室被以处决方式枪杀。就像超级摩托车枪击案一样，银行袭击发生在光天化日之下，没有目击者。这看起来并非随机事件。而且与超级摩托车运动中心的位置相似，蓝岭储蓄银行靠近高速公路，处于相对偏僻的地区。一辆红色汽车在下午1点24分被看到驶向银行，即枪击发生前六分钟，而一辆红色汽车也被发现在超级摩托车运动中心附近。截至2003年11月，银行枪击案的肇事者尚未被抓获或确认身份。

15
00:11:14.000 --> 00:12:13.000
However, while money was stolen from the bank in Greer Investigators knew almost immediately that the superbike slayings hadn't been part of a robbery Nothing had been taken from the store, not even an envelope full of cash that had been left on a counter Presumably the deposit Beverly had been planning to make The store also had numerous expensive items and a gold plated award that Scott had received, none of which were touched With the robbery ruled out as a motive, investigators believed they were looking at a more personal attack Scott Ponder had opened a superbike motorsports in January 2001 and the business had gone from strength to strength Scott hired his best friend Brian Lucas, who was a skilled mechanic as well as a fellow motorcycle expert
然而，虽然格里尔银行的钱被偷了，但调查人员几乎立刻就知道超级摩托车谋杀案并非抢劫的一部分。店里什么都没丢，甚至连柜台上放着的一信封现金都没动，那大概是贝弗利计划去存的钱。店里还有许多昂贵的物品和斯科特获得的一座镀金奖杯，这些都没有被触碰。排除了抢劫动机后，调查人员认为这是一起更具针对性的个人袭击。斯科特·庞德于2001年1月开设了超级摩托车运动中心，生意蒸蒸日上。斯科特聘请了他的挚友布莱恩·卢卡斯，他不仅是一位技术娴熟的技工，也是一位摩托车专家。

16
00:12:13.000 --> 00:13:00.000
The pair's genuine passion for motorbikes was appealing to customers As one of the largest Suzuki dealerships across two counties had attracted a lot of clientele in the area But Scott wasn't satisfied with the just selling locally He utilized the internet to sell to customers all over the United States At the beginning of the 21st century online shopping was still in its infancy This put Scott ahead of the curve As well as stocking motorcycles, superbike motorsports also sold ATVs and go-karts This widened their customer base to outdoor enthusiasts and young families
两人对摩托车的真诚热情吸引了顾客。作为两个县内最大的铃木经销商之一，它吸引了该地区大量的客户。但斯科特并不满足于仅仅在当地销售。他利用互联网向全美各地的客户销售。在21世纪初，在线购物还处于起步阶段。这让斯科特走在了时代前沿。除了销售摩托车，超级摩托车运动中心还销售全地形车和卡丁车。这扩大了他们的客户群，涵盖了户外运动爱好者和年轻家庭。

17
00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:54.000
In its first year, the store made more than $1 million in sales This allowed Scott to expand quickly, remodeling and extending the dealership's garage and taking on more staff Had Scott's success made he store the target of a rival business who was looking to get rid of their competition There were also rumors that the killer could have been a disgruntled customer One person who'd recently visited the dealership told the media that he'd seen buyers quote totally flip out upon receiving expensive bills Investigators also heard stories that superbike's prices were sometimes considered excessive The dealership's customer base was examined, but no one stood out as suspicious
在第一年，该店的销售额就超过了100万美元。这使得斯科特能够迅速扩张，改造并扩建了店里的车库，并雇佣了更多员工。斯科特的成功是否让这家店成为了竞争对手的目标？也有传言称凶手可能是一名不满的顾客。一位最近访问过该店的人告诉媒体，他曾看到买家在收到昂贵的账单时“彻底崩溃”。调查人员还听说超级摩托车的价格有时被认为过高。店里的客户群受到了审查，但没有人显得可疑。

18
00:13:54.000 --> 00:14:48.000
The investigative spotlight highlighted Noel Lee, the friend of Scott and Brian's who had discovered the crime scene Noel had a cell phone, but it stepped over his friend's bodies and entered the store to call 911 from the phone inside For all he knew, the killer might have still been in the building Yet, Noel opted to go in anyway He had also told the 911 operator that the dealership's mechanic had been shot Even though he supposedly hadn't seen Chris Sherbert's body or entered the garage at all Noel couldn't explain why he'd used the store's phone instead of his own except that he hadn't been thinking clearly due to shock He had presumed that Chris had been shot as well because the other three employees all were
调查的焦点转向了发现犯罪现场的斯科特和布莱恩的朋友诺埃尔·李。诺埃尔有手机，但他跨过朋友的尸体进入店内，用店里的电话拨打了911。据他所知，凶手可能还在楼里。然而，诺埃尔还是选择了进去。他还告诉911接线员店里的技工被枪杀了，尽管他理应没有看到克里斯·谢伯特的尸体，也没有进入车库。诺埃尔无法解释为什么他用店里的电话而不是自己的，只能说是因为震惊导致他思维混乱。他推测克里斯也被枪杀了，因为其他三名员工都遭到了枪击。

19
00:14:48.000 --> 00:15:38.000
Noel was fingerprinted and had his car dusted for prints. He also took a polygraph test None of these results gave officers any further reason to be suspicious Noel Lee was cleared from the suspect list Sheriff's deputies discovered that Chris Sherbert had been scheduled to front court several days later on Monday, November 10 He had been charged with some drug-related offences Some suspected that he was planning to turn state's witness and testify against others in exchange for having the charges dropped If this was the case, investigators wondered whether the murders were committed by someone who wanted to silence Chris But this theory failed to gain momentum
诺埃尔被采集了指纹，他的车也被提取了指纹。他还接受了测谎仪测试。这些结果都没有给警官们任何进一步怀疑的理由。诺埃尔·李被从嫌疑人名单中剔除。警长副手发现克里斯·谢伯特原定于几天后的11月10日星期一出庭。他被指控犯有一些与毒品有关的罪行。有人怀疑他计划转为污点证人，通过指证他人来换取撤销指控。如果是这样，调查人员想知道谋杀案是否是想让克里斯闭嘴的人所为。但这一理论未能获得进展。

20
00:15:38.000 --> 00:16:33.000
Investigators were also interested to learn that Scott Ponder hadn't really known his father He had been raised more by his stepfather, Terry Guy Scott's biological father, William Dean Ponder, had an extensive rap sheet dating back to 1976 It included property crimes, weapons violations and drug and alcohol offences In mid-1993, William had just been released from a stint in prison and was living in his parents' home on Parris Bridge Road Directly across the street from the store his son would open almost a decade later On the night of Saturday, August 28, 1993, 41-year-old William went out drinking with some friends at a nearby bar He failed to return home
调查人员还饶有兴趣地了解到，斯科特·庞德并不真正了解他的亲生父亲。他更多是由继父特里·盖伊抚养长大的。斯科特的亲生父亲威廉·迪恩·庞德有着自1976年以来的大量犯罪记录。其中包括财产犯罪、武器违规以及毒品和酒精犯罪。1993年中期，威廉刚从监狱服刑期满释放，住在巴黎桥路他父母的家中。那条路就在他儿子近十年后开设的商店对面。1993年8月28日星期六晚上，41岁的威廉和朋友去附近的一家酒吧喝酒。他没能回家。

21
00:16:33.000 --> 00:17:24.000
